          html: `<p>Quorums tune the <strong>probability</strong> of reading stale data; they do not guarantee freshness. Several everyday events break the overlap argument, and <strong>sloppy quorums</strong> deliberately give it up in exchange for accepting writes during a partition.</p>`,
